!#Reaction Mechanism Pyridine 3.2
!Experimental and kinetic study of pyridine pyrolysis with tunable synchrotron VUV photoionization and molecular beam mass spectrometry
!Cheng-Yin Ye (a,b), Ling-Nan Wu (a,b,c,*), Dong-Xu Tian (a,b), Jiu-Zhong Yang (d), Long Zhao (d), Zhen-Yu Tian (a,b,*)
!(a) Institute of Engineering Thermophysics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100190, China
!(b) University of Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 101408, China
!(c) State Key Laboratory of Coal Conversion, Institute of Engineering Thermophysics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing 100190, China
!(d) National Synchrotron Radiation Laboratory, University of Science and Technology of China, Hefei 230029, Anhui, China
!#Notice:
!#the Plog and Chebyshev rate expressions, only available for Chemkin(Java) version >4.0, Cantera version>2.0, Opensmoke or CHEMKIN-II with P-plog interpreter.!
!#some of lumped reaction from Polimi mechanism may increase the stiffness of the mechanism lead to the converge problem!
!#the chebyshev rate experssions may lead to the converge problem and should note their pressure and temperature range!
